message: Please cite this software using these metadata or in the CITATION file.
type: software
title: CODEM
abstract: CODEM is a testbed application for registering a 3D model of an area
of interest (AOI) to a larger 3D Foundation data source. Point cloud, mesh,
and raster digital surface model (DSM) data types are supported
url: https://github.com/
repository-code: https://github.com/NCALM-UH/codem
license: Apache-2.0
